      <marc:subfield code="a">Calling Anna and Bennett&apos;s romance long distance is an understatement. She&apos;s from 1995 Chicago, and he&apos;s a time traveller from 2012 San Francisco. They never should have met, but they did. They fell in love, even though they knew they shouldn&apos;t. And they found a way to stay together, against all the odds. It&apos;s not perfect. Bennett can&apos;t stay in the past for more than a few days at a time. But they&apos;re sure they can make it work...until he travels into the future and witnesses a single even he never, ever should have seen.</marc:subfield>
